{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1143166-what-were-the-mechanics-behind-green-dragon-s-fall","id":1143166,"title":"What were the mechanics behind Green Dragon's fall?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-23T00:37:49-07:00","id":1143166,"title":"What were the mechanics behind Green Dragon's fall?","content":"I am considering running a story that will feature Green Dragon, and I am curious how he fell with the White Howlers and hypothetically, how could he be restored. Was it trauma of some sort, or was it some sort of spiritual poisoning resulting from so many Garou he was attached to suddenly falling to the Wyrm? Bat could potentially be partially redeemed if his sense of hope could be restored, but where is Green Dragon vulnerable to being converted back to Gaia?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-23T02:07:00-07:00","id":1143177,"title":"","content":"Green Dragon is arguably the single hardest Totem to restore. <br /> Yes it was poisoned by the fall of so many of his Packs to the Wyrm but also a large amount of what Green Dragon is entwines firmly with a lot of things that are &quot;of the Wyrm&quot;. For a redemption story of this totem is probably better to be the focus of a Chronicle or a major Story Arc within a Chroncicle. Several Stories should run towards that goal and don't forget you can completely adjust what you need to in the history of Green Dragon to do what you need to do. Plus your players characters should get that learning experience, in fact that should be Story/Plot point 1 learning that history/uncovering the truths behind that fall. Once that is done (or while it's doing) listen to the players responses, that will give yo the spring board for the rest of the story arc and plot points and it'll reward their ideas and make it looked like a carefully crafted story all along <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T14:01:19-07:00","id":1146440,"title":"","content":"Might want to also address what happens with Zhyzhak and her pack, given that Green Dragon acts as their pack totem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/350